---
const title = "NOCTIS";
---

<nav class="nav" aria-label="Navegación principal">
  <a href="#inicio" class="nav__brand">NOCTIS</a>
  <ul class="nav__links">
    <li><a href="#valor">Origen</a></li>
    <li><a href="#concepto">Filosofía</a></li>
    <li><a href="#visual">Espacio</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contacto">Adquirir</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<section id="inicio" class="hero">
  <div class="hero__content">
    <h1 class="hero__title">
      <span class="hero__title-accent">La</span> luz que nace
      <br>de la oscuridad
    </h1>
    <p class="hero__subtitle">Velas artesanales de carbono puro. Cada pieza se funde en silencio, liberando aromas extraídos de bosques antiguos y resinas raras.</p>
    <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn--primary">Descubrir la colección</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__visual">
    <div class="hero__form">
      <div class="form__silhouette"></div>
      <div class="form__flame"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="valor" class="value">
  <div class="value__intro">
    <p class="value__lead">Noctis no fabrica velas. Libera lo que la oscuridad ha guardado durante siglos.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="value__benefits">
    <div class="benefit">
      <span class="benefit__number">01</span>
      <div class="benefit__body">
        <h3 class="benefit__title">Origen rastreable</h3>
        <p class="benefit__text">Cada mecha y cada aroma llevan un sello de procedencia. Sabemos exactamente qué bosque, qué árbol y qué estación. No hay ambigüedad en nuestro proceso.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="benefit">
      <span class="benefit__number">02</span>
      <div class="benefit__body">
        <h3 class="benefit__title">Combustión limpia</h3>
        <p class="benefit__text">Cera de abedul y cera de soja. Sin parafina, sin fragancias sintéticas. La combustión no produce hollín ni olores residuales — solo calidez y aroma puro.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="benefit">
      <span class="benefit__number">03</span>
      <div class="benefit__body">
        <h3 class="benefit__title">Ciclo cerrado</h3>
        <p class="benefit__text">El recipiente de cerámica se rellena con un kit de recarga. Devuelve el vaso vacío y lo restauramos. Nada termina en basura.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="concepto" class="concept">
  <div class="concept__wrapper">
    <div class="concept__axis">
      <span class="concept__label">Eje central</span>
      <div class="concept__divider"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="concept__main">
      <h2 class="concept__heading">La oscuridad no es ausencia.<br>Es un material.</h2>
      <p class="concept__paragraph">Para quienes entienden que la noche no se combate, se habita. Noctis nace de esa convicción: la luz no es un refugio contra la oscuridad, sino un diálogo con ella. Cada vela es un punto de contacto — un lugar donde ambos extremos se encuentran sin renunciar a su naturaleza.</p>
      <p class="concept__paragraph">No iluminamos para huir. Iluminamos para sentir.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="concept__aside">
      <p class="concept__aside-text">«Enciende la vela. Deja que la sombra haga su trabajo.»</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="visual" class="poster">
  <div class="poster__grid">
    <div class="poster__block poster__block--text">
      <span class="poster__mega">NOCTIS</span>
      <p class="poster__sub">Estudio de luz y carbono · Desde 2019</p>
    </div>

    <div class="poster__block poster__block--shape">
      <div class="shape-ring"></div>
      <div class="shape-dot"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="poster__block">
      <div class="poster__line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="poster__block poster__block--text">
      <p class="poster__small">Oscuridad · Carbono · Calor · Silencio</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contacto" class="closing">
  <div class="closing__content">
    <p class="closing__tag">Colección 2025 — 12 piezas</p>
    <h2 class="closing__heading">La noche tiene su propia<br>llamada.</h2>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn--primary">Solicitar un ejemplar</a>
    <p class="closing__note">Producción limitada. Cada lote se quema a mano y se numera.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    @keyframes flicker {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.85; }
      50% { opacity: 1; }
    }
  }
</style>

<style>
  /* ===== RESET & BASE ===== */
  .nav,
  .hero,
  .value,
  .concept,
  .poster,
  .closing {
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }

  /* ===== NAV ===== */
  .nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1.25rem 2rem;
    background: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.6);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .nav__brand {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .nav__brand:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #c8a86e;
    outline-offset: 4px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .nav__links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .nav__links a {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.55);
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: color 0.25s;
  }

  .nav__links a:hover,
  .nav__links a:focus-visible {
    color: #f5f0e8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .nav {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      background: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.85);
    }

    .nav__links {
      gap: 1.25rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  /* ===== SCROLL OFFSET ===== */
  .nav {
    scroll-margin-top: 0;
  }

  .hero,
  .value,
  .concept,
  .poster,
  .closing {
    scroll-margin-top: 5.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero,
    .value,
    .concept,
    .poster,
    .closing {
      scroll-margin-top: 7rem;
    }
  }

  /* ===== HERO ===== */
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.55fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 7rem 2rem 2rem;
    background: #0b0b0b;
    color: #f5f0e8;
  }

  .hero__content {
    padding-right: 1rem;
  }

  .hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  .hero__title-accent {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #c8a86e;
  }

  .hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.55);
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero__visual {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .hero__form {
    position: relative;
    width: 220px;
    height: 300px;
  }

  .form__silhouette {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: #1a1815;
    border-radius: 12px 12px 60% 60%;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .form__silhouette::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 18%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    background: #c8a86e;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px 16px rgba(200, 168, 110, 0.35),
                0 0 80px 30px rgba(200, 168, 110, 0.15);
    animation: flicker 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .form__silhouette::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 10%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 30px;
    height: 60px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(200, 168, 110, 0.25) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(8px);
    animation: flicker 3.5s ease-in-out infinite 0.5s;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
      padding-top: 8rem;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .hero__content {
      padding-right: 0;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .hero__subtitle {
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .hero__visual {
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
  }

  /* ===== BENEFITS ===== */
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1rem 2.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #0b0b0b;
    background: #c8a86e;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.25s;
  }

  .btn:hover,
  .btn:focus-visible {
    background: #d4b782;
  }

  .btn--primary {
    background: #c8a86e;
    color: #0b0b0b;
  }

  .btn--primary:hover,
  .btn--primary:focus-visible {
    background: #d4b782;
  }

  /* ===== VALUE ===== */
  .value {
    background: #f5f0e8;
    color: #0b0b0b;
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
  }

  .value__intro {
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .value__lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .value__benefits {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .benefit {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.1);
  }

  .benefit:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.1);
  }

  .benefit__number {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #c8a86e;
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .benefit__body {
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .benefit__title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .benefit__text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.6);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .value {
      padding: 4rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .benefit {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .benefit__number {
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }
  }

  /* ===== CONCEPT ===== */
  .concept {
    background: #0b0b0b;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    padding: 7rem 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .concept__wrapper {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .concept__axis {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .concept__label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c8a86e;
  }

  .concept__divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.15);
  }

  .concept__main {
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .concept__heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  .concept__paragraph {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.55);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .concept__paragraph:last-child {
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(200, 168, 110, 0.7);
  }

  .concept__aside {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.08);
  }

  .concept__aside-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #c8a86e;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .concept {
      padding: 5rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .concept__wrapper {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .concept__main {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .concept__aside {
      grid-column: 1;
    }
  }

  /* ===== POSTER ===== */
  .poster {
    background: #141210;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 70vh;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .poster__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .poster__block {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 120px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .poster__block--text {
    grid-column: 1 / 3;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .poster__mega {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 200;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .poster__sub {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.4);
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .poster__block--shape {
    grid-column: 3;
    grid-row: 1 / -1;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .shape-ring {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(200, 168, 110, 0.3);
    border-radius: 50%;
    position: relative;
  }

  .shape-ring::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(200, 168, 110, 0.5) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .shape-dot {
    position: absolute;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: #c8a86e;
    border-radius: 50%;
    top: 15%;
    right: 20%;
  }

  .poster__line {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(200, 168, 110, 0.3) 30%, rgba(200, 168, 110, 0.3) 70%, transparent);
  }

  .poster__block--text:last-of-type {
    grid-column: 1 / 3;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .poster__small {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.35em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.35);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 2;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .poster {
      padding: 4rem 1.25rem;
      min-height: 60vh;
    }

    .poster__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .poster__block--text {
      grid-column: 1;
      text-align: center;
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .poster__block--shape {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: auto;
    }

    .poster__block:last-of-type {
      grid-column: 1;
      text-align: center;
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .poster__mega {
      text-align: center;
    }
  }

  /* ===== CLOSING ===== */
  .closing {
    background: #0b0b0b;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    padding: 8rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .closing__content {
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .closing__tag {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.4);
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  .closing__heading {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .closing__note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.35);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .closing {
      padding: 5rem 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
